"Healer Yenu-pezth is an Artonan mind healer whom Stuart arranged for Alden to see."
"Her first session with Alden is a walk on Artona I, in a place that eases the mind."
"She wears a loose purplish-gray braid and two thin forehead tattoo lines, and goes barefoot."
"Her House of Healing near Vethedya has its own grove and the inward path, a dug-out maze."
"On the inward path she lays a calming weight on a patient, making thoughts easy to reach."
"She once stole young Stuart away from another healer to fly kites, then made the Primary pause."
"Alden is her first human patient; she is replacing his Thegund nightmare with a dream he crafts."
